    "body": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\" ?>\n<?xml-stylesheet href=\"https://rss.buzzsprout.com/styles.xsl\" type=\"text/xsl\"?>\n<rss version=\"2.0\" xmlns:itunes=\"http://www.itunes.com/dtds/podcast-1.0.dtd\" xmlns:podcast=\"https://podcastindex.org/namespace/1.0\" xmlns:content=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\" xmlns:psc=\"http://podlove.org/simple-chapters\" xmlns:atom=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom\">\n<channel>\n  <atom:link href=\"https://rss.buzzsprout.com/1.rss\" rel=\"self\" type=\"application/rss+xml\" />\n  <atom:link href=\"https://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/\" rel=\"hub\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom\" />\n  <title>How to Start a Podcast</title>\n\n  <lastBuildDate>Wed, 08 Jul 2026 11:10:33 -0400</lastBuildDate>\n  <link>https://www.buzzsprout.com/1</link>\n  <language>en-us</language>\n  <copyright>© 2026 How to Start a Podcast</copyright>\n  <podcast:locked>yes</podcast:locked>\n  <podcast:location geo=\"geo:30.3321838,-81.65565099999999\">Jacksonville, FL, USA</podcast:location>\n    <podcast:guid>7d1a25c1-c5d2-540b-95eb-ba83ec2521de</podcast:guid>\n  <itunes:author>Buzzsprout</itunes:author>\n  <itunes:type>serial</itunes:type>\n  <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>\n  <description><![CDATA[<p>“How to Start a Podcast” is a serial podcast that teaches you how to create a podcast from scratch. Presented by Buzzsprout, this podcast is perfect for the newbie podcaster, the established podcaster who wants to make sure they have all their bases covered, or someone who wants to learn more about what it’s like to make a podcast. Start your podcast for FREE at Buzzsprout.com</p>]]></description>\n  <generator>Buzzsprout (https://www.buzzsprout.com)</generator>\n  <itunes:keywords>podcasting, how to podcast, podcast strategies, podcast tutorial</itunes:keywords>\n  <itunes:owner>\n    <itunes:name>Buzzsprout</itunes:name>\n  </itunes:owner>\n  <image>\n     <url>https://storage.buzzsprout.com/tprx03v0tizrqo5txtadsc7on396?.jpg</url>\n     <title>How to Start a Podcast</title>\n     <link>https://www.buzzsprout.com/1</link>\n  </image>\n  <itunes:image href=\"https://storage.buzzsprout.com/tprx03v0tizrqo5txtadsc7on396?.jpg\" />\n  <itunes:category text=\"Education\">\n    <itunes:category text=\"How To\" />\n  </itunes:category>\n  <itunes:category text=\"Education\">\n    <itunes:category text=\"Courses\" />\n  </itunes:category>\n  <itunes:category text=\"Education\" />\n  <item>\n    <itunes:title>The Key to Making Your Podcast Stand Out // Eric Nuzum</itunes:title>\n    <title>The Key to Making Your Podcast Stand Out // Eric Nuzum</title>\n    <itunes:summary><![CDATA[In this special bonus episode, Travis sits down with one of the godfathers of podcasting - Eric Nuzum.  Eric created and developed podcasts such as TED Radio Hour, Invisibilia, Fresh Air with Terry Gross, and many others and he shares that wisdom and expertise in his new book Make Noise: A Creator's Guide To Podcasting And Great Audio Storytelling. ]]></itunes:summary>\n    <description><![CDATA[<p>In this special bonus episode, Travis sits down with one of the godfathers of podcasting - Eric Nuzum.<br/><br/>Eric created and developed podcasts such as <em>TED Radio Hour</em>, <em>Invisibilia</em>, <em>Fresh Air with Terry Gross</em>, and many others and he shares that wisdom and expertise in his new book <a href='https://www.amazon.com/Make-Noise-Creators-Podcasting-Storytelling/dp/1523504552/ref=sr_1_2?keywords=make+noise&amp;qid=1579813278&amp;sr=8-2'><b>Make Noise: A Creator&apos;s Guide To Podcasting And Great Audio Storytelling.</b></a></p>]]></description>\n    <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>In this special bonus episode, Travis sits down with one of the godfathers of podcasting - Eric Nuzum.<br/><br/>Eric created and developed podcasts such as <em>TED Radio Hour</em>, <em>Invisibilia</em>, <em>Fresh Air with Terry Gross</em>, and many others and he shares that wisdom and expertise in his new book <a href='https://www.amazon.com/Make-Noise-Creators-Podcasting-Storytelling/dp/1523504552/ref=sr_1_2?keywords=make+noise&amp;qid=1579813278&amp;sr=8-2'><b>Make Noise: A Creator&apos;s Guide To Podcasting And Great Audio Storytelling.</b></a></p>]]></content:encoded>\n    <enclosure url=\"https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/www.buzzsprout.com/1/episodes/2562823-the-key-to-making-your-podcast-stand-out-eric-nuzum.mp3\" length=\"25757065\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" />\n    <link>https://www.buzzsprout.com/1/2562823</link>\n    <itunes:author>Eric Nuzum</itunes:author>\n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">Buzzsprout-2562823</guid>\n    <pubDate>Thu, 11 Jan 2024 00:00:00 -0500</pubDate>\n    <podcast:transcript url=\"https://www.buzzsprout.com/1/2562823/transcript\" type=\"text/html\" />\n    <podcast:transcript url=\"https://www.buzzsprout.com/1/2562823/transcript.json\" type=\"application/json\" />\n    <podcast:transcript url=\"https://www.buzzsprout.com/1/2562823/transcript.srt\" type=\"application/x-subrip\" />\n    <podcast:transcript url=\"https://www.buzzsprout.com/1/2562823/transcript.vtt\" type=\"text/vtt\" />\n    <itunes:duration>2144</itunes:duration>\n    <itunes:keywords></itunes:keywords>\n    <itunes:season>1</itunes:season>\n    <itunes:episodeType>bonus</itunes:episodeType>\n    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>\n  </item>\n  <item>\n    <itunes:title>Podcast promotion: launching and growing your show</itunes:title>\n    <title>Podcast promotion: launching and growing your show</title>\n    <itunes:summary><![CDATA[In Episode 10 of How to Start a Podcast, you'll learn how to launch a new podcast and our top 5 marketing strategies to gain momentum early.  Next Steps: How to set up an Instagram account for your podcast (Video) Top 6 Ways to Promote a New Podcast (Video)Grow Your Podcast By Advertising in Podcast Apps (Blog)]]></itunes:summary>\n    <description><![CDATA[<p>In Episode 10 of How to Start a Podcast, you&apos;ll learn how to launch a new podcast and our top 5 marketing strategies to gain momentum early.<br/><br/><b>Next Steps:</b></p><ul><li><a href='https://youtu.be/600qFHQzvC0'>How to set up an Instagram account for your podcast</a> (Video) </li><li><a href='https://youtu.be/qWqAnWQFfyA'>Top 6 Ways to Promote a New Podcast</a> (Video)</li><li><a href='https://www.buzzsprout.com/blog/advertising-in-podcast-apps'>Grow Your Podcast By Advertising in Podcast Apps</a> (Blog)</li></ul>]]></description>\n    <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>In Episode 10 of How to Start a Podcast, you&apos;ll learn how to launch a new podcast and our top 5 marketing strategies to gain momentum early.<br/><br/><b>Next Steps:</b></p><ul><li><a href='https://youtu.be/600qFHQzvC0'>How to set up an Instagram account for your podcast</a> (Video) </li><li><a href='https://youtu.be/qWqAnWQFfyA'>Top 6 Ways to Promote a New Podcast</a> (Video)</li><li><a href='https://www.buzzsprout.com/blog/advertising-in-podcast-apps'>Grow Your Podcast By Advertising in Podcast Apps</a> (Blog)</li></ul>]]></content:encoded>\n    <enclosure url=\"https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/www.buzzsprout.com/1/episodes/10167133-podcast-promotion-launching-and-growing-your-show.mp3\" length=\"18505549\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" />\n    <itunes:author>Buzzsprout</itunes:author>\n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">Buzzsprout-10167133</guid>\n    <pubDate>Wed, 10 Jan 2024 00:00:00 -0500</pubDate>\n    <podcast:transcript url=\"https://www.buzzsprout.com/1/10167133/transcript\" type=\"text/html\" />\n    <podcast:transcript url=\"https://www.buzzsprout.com/1/10167133/transcript.json\" type=\"application/json\" />\n    <podcast:transcript url=\"https://www.buzzsprout.com/1/10167133/transcript.srt\" type=\"application/x-subrip\" />\n    <podcast:transcript url=\"https://www.buzzsprout.com/1/10167133/transcript.vtt\" type=\"text/vtt\" />\n    <podcast:chapters url=\"https://www.buzzsprout.com/1/10167133/chapters.json\" type=\"application/json\" />\n    <psc:chapters>\n  <psc:chapter start=\"0:00\