ode using Buzzsprout.<br/><br/><b>Next Steps:</b></p><ul><li><a href='https://youtu.be/2VDNxqFBq7I'>Next Level Tools to Power Up Your Podcast [Buzzsprout Overview]</a><a href='https://youtu.be/9KwvE4nrGX4'> </a>(Video</li><li><a href='https://youtu.be/oGG8fVljQdg'>Make Your Podcast Sound Professional with Mixing and Mastering</a> (Video)</li><li><a href='https://www.buzzsprout.com/help'>Buzzsprout&apos;s Help Section</a></li></ul><p><br/><b>Other Things We Mentioned:</b></p><ul><li><a href='https://www.buzzsprout.com/help/60-transcripts'>Transcriptions</a></li><li><a href='https://www.buzzsprout.com/help/10-site-theme'>Podcast Websites</a></li><li><a href='https://www.buzzsprout.com/help/67-magic-mastering'>Magic Mastering</a></li><li><a href='https://www.buzzsprout.com/help/57-setup-visual-soundbite'>Visual Soundbites</a></li></ul>]]></content:encoded>\n    <enclosure url=\"https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/www.buzzsprout.com/1/episodes/10137707-podcast-hosting-setting-up-your-show-on-buzzsprout.mp3\" length=\"15770221\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" />\n    <itunes:author>Buzzsprout</itunes:author>\n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">Buzzsprout-10137707</guid>\n    <pubDate>Mon, 08 Jan 2024 00:00:00 -0500</pubDate>\n    <podcast:transcript url=\"https://www.buzzsprout.com/1/10137707/transcript\" type=\"text/html\" />\n    <podcast:transcript url=\"https://www.buzzsprout.com/1/10137707/transcript.json\" type=\"application/json\" />\n    <podcast:transcript url=\"https://www.buzzsprout.com/1/10137707/transcript.srt\" type=\"application/x-subrip\" />\n    <podcast:transcript url=\"https://www.buzzsprout.com/1/10137707/transcript.vtt\" type=\"text/vtt\" />\n    <podcast:chapters url=\"https://www.buzzsprout.com/1/10137707/chapters.json\" type=\"application/json\" />\n    <psc:chapters>\n  <psc:chapter start=\"0:00\" title=\"Intro\" />\n  <psc:chapter start=\"0:55\" title=\"Signing up for Buzzsprout\" />\n  <psc:chapter start=\"9:44\" title=\"Upload your first episode\" />\n  <p